3α² + kα + 3 = 0 ...(1)

and

α² + kα - 1 = 0 ...(2)

So, we have two equations (1) and (2). Let me try to solve them simultaneously.

From equation (2), we can express α² = -kα + 1. Let me substitute this into equation (1):

